\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Thou God, to whom I go for  refuge'
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 So that I'll not be put to shame
\par Save me from touble by your piety,
\par Redeem me, give heed unto me!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par To me, be like a rock so solid,
\par Upon which I shall sit always.
\par You are the fortress, shield of my soul
\par And has vowed not to take my life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  My God, save me a poor transgressor
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 From the arms of the wicked men
\par For you alone are my only hope,
\par You brought me from my mother's womb.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Therefore, from my early infancy
\par I learned to put my trust in you;
\par And it's as if from the day of birth
\par I leaned upon you with my back.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\cf0  Truly you are my source of solace,
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 You have become a rock to me;
\par You've cared for me so amazingly
\par Before the eyes of multitudes,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par For which cause I'll give you praise daily
\par And give you glory everyday.
\par You have revealed your pow'r unto me;
\par My mouth is full of praise for you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. My enemies do speak about me;
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 As if God has forsaken me
\par They do conspire against me daily,
\par Ambush me and hide to destroy
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Pursue, they call, and make him desperate,
\par There is no Saviour to his aid!
\par And you my Lord,  do not forsake me,
\par But make haste and come to my aid!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  My enemies will fail to get me,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 And shame will be their just reward.
\par But as for me, I shall keep waiting,
\par And offer my praises to God
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My mouth shall speak of your holiness,
\par And salvation each even time.
\par That since my childhood you've cared for me
\par And left your legacy of grace.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Your holiness does overwhelm me,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 It is you that has done great things.
\par Who in this world is equal to thee?
\par In you I've had my salvation!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Therefore I praise you for honesty
\par My lips sing your praises each day,
\par And I keep on relying on you,
\par I've  completely receive  solace.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

